<title>SWEDEN: Esselte posts 2 pct rise in Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Esselte posts 2 pct rise in Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office supplier Esselte on Thursday posted its results for the three months ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				194 vs   190</p>
<p> Sales					 3,152 vs 3,022</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		 3.60 vs  3.50</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold			2,151 vs 2,023</p>
<p> Selling costs				 565 vs   556</p>
<p> Admin costs				   205 vs   199</p>
<p> Operating profit			    198 vs   203</p>
<p> Net financial items		 CHARGE  4 vs    13 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax						70 vs    70</p>
<p> Net profit				    124 vs   120</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
